<title>USA: Photronics to buy German photomask co.</title>
<headline>Photronics to buy German photomask co.</headline>
<dateline>JUPITER, Fla. 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Photronics Inc said Friday that it has reached an agreement in principle with MZD Maskenzentrum fur Mikrostrukturierung Dresden GmbH, to acquire MZD's independent photomask manufacturing operation located in Dresden, Germany.</p>
<p>Financial terms of the agreement were not disclosed.</p>
<p>MZD, a former state run company, employs 27 people, all of whom will be retained by Photronics.</p>
<p>The company was privatized shortly after East and West Germany were reunified.</p>
</text>
